  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/4) by Former user (Bitbucket: [Former user](https://bitbucket.org/Former user), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nI shoot RAW\\+JPEG. For portrait shots ART seems to ignore the orientation for the JPEGs, RAW is fine. The issue affects File Browser and Editor.\n\nConverted JPEGs seem to be uneffected.\n\nHere is a screenshot of the file browser with RAWS, OOC JPEGs and one converted jpeg.\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/1933227678-jpeg_orientation.jpg)\n‌\n\nAnd here an OOC Jpeg:\n\n[https://www.dropbox.com/s/ozsxtjn44rju2bc/PC249384.JPG?dl=0](https://www.dropbox.com/s/ozsxtjn44rju2bc/PC249384.JPG?dl=0)\n",
